    {
      "source": "Aggregator of multiple <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/MappingException.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>MappingException</code></a> for convenience when verifying persistent entities. This allows the\nframework to communicate all verification errors to the user of the framework, rather than one at a time.",
